WEBVTT

00:00:00.907 --> 00:00:01.553
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.392 --> 00:00:05.849
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> people who have to travel a long way to get to work

00:00:07.862 --> 00:00:08.486
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.535 --> 00:00:12.275
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> … a mechanical staircase that moves up and down,

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:15.835
for example in a station or a department store

00:00:17.799 --> 00:00:18.559
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:19.615 --> 00:00:22.221
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> … when cars, lorries, etc.

00:00:22.357 --> 00:00:25.422
stop moving because there are so many of them

00:00:27.423 --> 00:00:28.155
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:29.155 --> 00:00:32.206
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> the raised part of the street where people walk

00:00:35.171 --> 00:00:36.010
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:36.999 --> 00:00:42.875
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> the red, orange, and green lights that show when cars must stop and when they can go

00:00:44.835 --> 00:00:45.642
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:46.873 --> 00:00:50.387
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> the people who live in a village, town, or city